  "lineage": "Producer-driven Brazilian funk edit form crystallised online from 2019 onward through Zetaphunk, DJ Miller and the Brazilian phonk-adjacent SoundCloud scene — 130-160 BPM 'montagem' collages that rapid-cut a single sampled vocal or melodic fragment into stuttered rhythmic patterns over the tamborzão or mandelão kick, using heavy pitch-shifting, reverse hits, sudden filter sweeps and abrupt tempo or key jumps within one track.",
